      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "(1) FixedWindowCounterStrategy\n   implements RateLimitStrategy\n──────────────\n- maxRequests: int\n- windowMillis: long\n- windowStart: long\n- count: int\n──────────────\n+ FixedWindowCounterStrategy(int, long)\n+ allow(): boolean  «sync»  O(1)\n\nReset counter on window roll.\nSimplest. Has the boundary\nburst bug: 2*max in adjacent\nwindows under 1 wall-second.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "(1) FixedWindowCounterStrategy\n   implements RateLimitStrategy\n──────────────\n- maxRequests: int\n- windowMillis: long\n- windowStart: long\n- count: int\n──────────────\n+ FixedWindowCounterStrategy(int, long)\n+ allow(): boolean  «sync»  O(1)\n\nReset counter on window roll.\nSimplest. Has the boundary\nburst bug: 2*max in adjacent\nwindows under 1 wall-second.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.2,
      "baseline": 231
    },
