      ],
      "updated": 1781898445981,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "(2) SlidingWindowLogStrategy\n   implements RateLimitStrategy\n──────────────\n- maxRequests: int\n- windowMillis: long\n- hitTimestamps:\n     ArrayDeque<Long>\n──────────────\n+ SlidingWindowLogStrategy(int, long)\n+ allow(): boolean  «sync»  O(1) amort.\n\nEvict timestamps older than\n(now - windowMillis), allow iff\nsize < max. Exact. Memory =\nO(maxRequests) per client.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "(2) SlidingWindowLogStrategy\n   implements RateLimitStrategy\n──────────────\n- maxRequests: int\n- windowMillis: long\n- hitTimestamps:\n     ArrayDeque<Long>\n──────────────\n+ SlidingWindowLogStrategy(int, long)\n+ allow(): boolean  «sync»  O(1) amort.\n\nEvict timestamps older than\n(now - windowMillis), allow iff\nsize < max. Exact. Memory =\nO(maxRequests) per client.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.2,
      "baseline": 231
    },
