      "locked": false,
      "text": "(3) SlidingWindowCounterStrategy\n   implements RateLimitStrategy\n──────────────\n- maxRequests: int\n- windowMillis: long\n- currentBucket: long\n- currentCount: int\n- previousCount: int\n──────────────\n+ SlidingWindowCounterStrategy(int, long)\n+ allow(): boolean  «sync»  O(1)\n\nestimate = curr + prev * overlap.\nO(1) memory. ~0.003% error.\nThe production sweet spot.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "(3) SlidingWindowCounterStrategy\n   implements RateLimitStrategy\n──────────────\n- maxRequests: int\n- windowMillis: long\n- currentBucket: long\n- currentCount: int\n- previousCount: int\n──────────────\n+ SlidingWindowCounterStrategy(int, long)\n+ allow(): boolean  «sync»  O(1)\n\nestimate = curr + prev * overlap.\nO(1) memory. ~0.003% error.\nThe production sweet spot.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.2,
      "baseline": 231
    },
