      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781898395042,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "(4) TokenBucketStrategy\n   implements RateLimitStrategy\n──────────────\n- capacity: long\n- refillRatePerSecond: double\n- tokens: double\n- lastRefillNanos: long\n──────────────\n+ TokenBucketStrategy(long, double)\n+ allow(): boolean  «sync»  O(1)\n- refill()                  O(1)\n\nLazy refill: tokens += elapsed *\nrate, capped at capacity. Allows\nbursts up to capacity, then\nsettles at rate. Starts FULL.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "(4) TokenBucketStrategy\n   implements RateLimitStrategy\n──────────────\n- capacity: long\n- refillRatePerSecond: double\n- tokens: double\n- lastRefillNanos: long\n──────────────\n+ TokenBucketStrategy(long, double)\n+ allow(): boolean  «sync»  O(1)\n- refill()                  O(1)\n\nLazy refill: tokens += elapsed *\nrate, capped at capacity. Allows\nbursts up to capacity, then\nsettles at rate. Starts FULL.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.2,
      "baseline": 246
    },
    {
