      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781898395042,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "(5) LeakyBucketStrategy\n   implements RateLimitStrategy\n──────────────\n- capacity: long\n- leakRatePerSecond: double\n- water: double\n- lastLeakNanos: long\n──────────────\n+ LeakyBucketStrategy(long, double)\n+ allow(): boolean  «sync»  O(1)\n- leak()                    O(1)\n\nLazy leak: water -= elapsed *\nleakRate (floored at 0). Allow\niff water + 1 <= capacity.\nStarts EMPTY. Queue-form\nshapes outgoing traffic.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "(5) LeakyBucketStrategy\n   implements RateLimitStrategy\n──────────────\n- capacity: long\n- leakRatePerSecond: double\n- water: double\n- lastLeakNanos: long\n──────────────\n+ LeakyBucketStrategy(long, double)\n+ allow(): boolean  «sync»  O(1)\n- leak()                    O(1)\n\nLazy leak: water -= elapsed *\nleakRate (floored at 0). Allow\niff water + 1 <= capacity.\nStarts EMPTY. Queue-form\nshapes outgoing traffic.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.2,
      "baseline": 262
    },
